<!--
  The reminder's small icon: the app's own mark, the qaf that begins the
  word Quran, drawn bolder than the launcher glyph so the loop, the two
  dots, and the sweeping tail survive the status bar's size. It is
  deliberately not a bell or a clock: every other reminder in the shade
  wears one of those, and this one is the app's own mark. Only the alpha
  channel is read, and the system tints the silhouette with the
  notification color on every skin (owner decision, D-126).
-->
